**/.DS_STORE
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Lean build tree and resolved dependency clones. `lake exe cache get` recreates both, and CI
# clones fresh, so committing them would ship several gigabytes of machine-specific state and
# nine embedded git repositories. The Mathlib revision is pinned in lakefile.toml, which is the
# thing that actually has to be under version control.
.lake/
lake-manifest.json

# Subagent git worktrees. Each is a throwaway checkout carrying its own multi-gigabyte Lean build
# tree, created for one execution round and removed when that round finishes; the deliverable
# always lands as a commit on the round's own branch, never from here. Only the worktrees are
# ignored, so tracked `.claude` configuration remains possible.
/.claude/worktrees/
